{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1000_p", "source_sha256": "59a77e3d69660708db2068f6975ebe01e4e53d422b61e56c50a755043a02a3be", "ja": "（今日は瑞希のPV撮影だ。\n学校の教室を借りて、撮影をしているが……）", "zh": "（今天是瑞希的PV拍摄。在学校的教室里借了场地进行拍摄，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "8bbbce218b5ac49fa760f92f53cd2b0605e14d22a3c3453c73f196f02faf54a5", "ja": "静かな教室で、ひとりぼっち。\nソワソワが止まらないぞ。……ソワソワ。", "zh": "在安静的教室里，孤零零的一个人。心里七上八下的，停不下来。……七上八下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dc1d4b4e932006270113013b6b9f2a0e9746b0f2fd2fb937fb50f8f76972273b", "ja": "大丈夫か、瑞希？\nいつもよりソワソワしてるけど。", "zh": "没事吧，瑞希？\n你看起来比平时更坐立不安呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "2d5aea290d4f2141543efe09f21515706387a758f509a2b5af5a4b9c65edc097", "ja": "{$P$}。\nそれが、困ったことになりました。", "zh": "{$P$}。问题是，事情变得有些棘手了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "39958be81074226383f9a18c493929df57c7e3fc149e0709dec71ab8af6dff06", "ja": "次のシーンは、私が歌いながら、踊り出すシーン。\n気持ちが高まって、自然と体が動き出してしまう……。", "zh": "接下来的场景，是我一边唱歌，一边跳起来的场景。\n情绪高涨，身体也不由自主地动了起来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "15447c861297f39596fb35e6b94e45c305187cc9e0385b840817ede8981474f7", "ja": "そんな風に見せたいのですが……。\nまだ気持ちが高まっていなくて……ピンチだぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "我想要表现出那种感觉，可是……情绪还没酝酿起来……这下糟了，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1006_p", "source_sha256": "78a0595cd2a170dc4cc01a1582939808081ec4c572c9483486953c9335d90cef", "ja": "たしかに、それはピンチだ……。\n気持ちを高めるために、何か手伝えることはあるか？", "zh": "确实，那可真是危机啊……\n有什么我能帮忙提升情绪的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "04e10d955bfd44ab487b1ff0d8a588bbf728b328b030d3e5669e4a39c405e7e7", "ja": "いいんですか？　では、{$P$}。\n付き合ってください。", "zh": "可以吗？那么，{$P$}。\n请陪我一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1008_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0d2b9a4b2309a43fef4c59051ae78c4b248fdc5cd9cd6de90f7c30bbecf5db9d", "ja": "（瑞希がトランプを持ってきた。気分を高めるために、\nどうやらポーカーで勝負をしたいらしい……）", "zh": "（瑞希拿来了扑克牌。为了调动气氛，她似乎想来一场扑克对决……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "e6484409d0bfae4f58af629a286e5117ff1ccf38e683c025d37049ba405d169c", "ja": "むむ……このままでは、むむむっ……ハッ。\nいけないいけない……キリッ。", "zh": "唔唔……这样下去可不行，唔唔唔……哈。不好不好……（神情一肃）。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b2818ad7060b62ec7414d65ba8ab61193f40491a697e82c049aa53b1feeae97b", "ja": "（さすが瑞希。少し声に漏れることはあるが、\n表情はまったく読めない……。これは手強い……）", "zh": "（不愧是瑞希。虽然偶尔会有一点声音泄露出来，\n但表情完全读不懂……真是个棘手的对手……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "6d32436ae4f936be279915fe8a820269ceae26840706941fcf83fa6e4d89799f", "ja": "{$P$}、退屈していませんか？\n……3枚ドローします。", "zh": "{$P$}，您没有觉得无聊吧？\n……我要抽3张牌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1013_p", "source_sha256": "58a597c9d71294516be7a312c3fdf3968c06408fc3d40bde21d2c61da4dbace7", "ja": "退屈なんて……むしろ、熱くなってるかな。\n相手の状況がわからなくて、ヒヤヒヤしてるよ。", "zh": "无聊什么的……倒不如说，我现在正热血沸腾呢。\n因为不知道对手的情况，真是让人提心吊胆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "42090745d1869d573639a3350f3241deb98e2ed088d8b6961505db2ccff87583", "ja": "そうですか。会話を楽しむ余裕があるということは、\nひょっとして、良い役が揃っていますか？", "zh": "这样啊。既然还有余裕享受聊天，  \n莫非已经凑齐了不错的牌型？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1015_p", "source_sha256": "91243d36ca2a3fc642861b6c571a7b6dba17d8312d2e70a98d90fc69e6e9c19f", "ja": "ははっ。誘導尋問には引っかからないぞ。\nこっちは、2枚交換しようかな。", "zh": "哈哈，我可不会上你的诱导审讯。\n我这边就交换2张吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "239ec6275623d4240c60e5258f115a313fb121599019409a7228f925b63e370d", "ja": "やはり、引っかかりませんか。\nですが、勝負はまだこれからです。……えい。", "zh": "果然没上当呢。\n不过，胜负现在才刚要开始。……喝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "9859a210a79341eb5d9f48c74c94b1e15fbb869e678a4d1b2d3563d543187528", "ja": "ありがとうございました。\n{$P$}、手強かったです。", "zh": "多谢指教。\n{$P$}，真难对付。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1018_p", "source_sha256": "da4de0255722ad7ed6724431168a7a525e5e48d2084a9c897f01d06a5d6b6f30", "ja": "そう言ってもらえて、嬉しいよ。\n白熱した勝負だったけど、結局引き分けだな。", "zh": "能听到你这么说，我很高兴。\n虽然是场激烈的较量，但最后还是平局啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "366bfeb6f6892047a182fed1f3eb70af07ad3729cc339eb3fbc160d40c9848ca", "ja": "はい。決着はいずれ。ですがひと勝負したおかげで、\n私の気持ちは盛り上がっています。……ぐっ。", "zh": "是的。胜负迟早会分出结果。不过多亏刚才较量了一场，我的情绪已经高涨起来了。……唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "4e1b93246b07751c2a63b4eeeefe50822cee6872ccc66b59d28c8734ccd3e8c0", "ja": "ところで、ひとつ聞きたいのですが。\n勝負の時の私の表情、どうでしたか？", "zh": "对了，我想问一件事。\n比赛时我的表情怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5989adf0d4690acbbd9def37971e7599cc7e05d0c6674446e3faa125623f78f1", "ja": "そうだな……。瑞希のポーカーフェイスがうますぎて、\n感情を読み取るのが大変だったな。", "zh": "是啊……瑞希的扑克脸实在太厉害了，很难看出她的情绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "88a3fd4ce1aaab08b5706cfd8152e0cd1d2becd77d676e962ccfedb0a34f410d", "ja": "なるほど。見られていると感じましたが、\nそういうことでしたか。……ドキドキ。", "zh": "原来如此。我感觉自己一直被注视着，原来是这么回事啊。……心跳加速。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1023_p", "source_sha256": "2e6d7db720a3224750be28ab9959c5499623ec019875ddc620fda46756699686", "ja": "瑞希？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "瑞希？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "a1a12949547429249d044de225505892ba708ca0e28f7501ebc71964c5fbfe1a", "ja": "何でもありません。ですが、今日の撮影は\nうまく行きそうな気がします。そんな予感がしました。", "zh": "没什么。不过，我觉得今天的拍摄会很顺利。刚才有这样的预感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "0b7a00a06972de595afffc38442a7f48195049136e72ed8aa132b1b43f0d3cc5", "ja": "見ていてください、{$P$}。必ず、\n素敵なPVにしてみせます……ファイトだぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "请看着吧，{$P$}。我一定会把它拍成精彩的PV……瑞希，加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0324_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4df5b7f17e03e7c3773bac4f58bcaa3379f4eb9b208f94053afb3a71490c067d", "ja": "（曲に合わせて、自然な歌とダンスが始まった。\n……瑞希の宣言どおり、素敵なPVになりそうだな！）", "zh": "（配合着曲子，自然的歌声与舞蹈开始了。……看来正如瑞希所说，这会成为一支精彩的PV啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
